{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（24日）中午12時40分，黃大仙慈雲山道8號德愛中學對開發生交通意外，一輛藍色Tesla沿慈雲山道快線南行，至上址行人過路處撞倒一名穿校服的男學生。</p><figure><img alt=\"慈雲山道發生交通意外，17歲學生被車撞倒受傷送院。（Facebook群組慈雲山資訊交流/Hoi圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261124/1201895413179748352718206.jpeg/0QSxeh-Kvf0emeG_0LilE0wabVMe3pPmZMa6VmTGulY\"/><figcaption>慈雲山道發生交通意外，17歲學生被車撞倒受傷送院。（Facebook群組慈雲山資訊交流/Hoi圖片）</figcaption></figure><p>傷者17歲，背部及左手受傷，多名熱心巿民上前了解，及後由救護車將他送往伊利沙伯醫院治理，警方正調查事故原因。</p><figure><img alt=\"傷者送往伊利沙伯醫院治理。（資料圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261124/1201897597837512704741206.jpeg/xXl0D-m9EUk4-Ti-eeurkwpEQ6OOlMVYgkO_gIJDv4A\"/><figcaption>傷者送往伊利沙伯醫院治理。（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T06:35:01.593118+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":203,"images":2,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T05:54:58+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T13:37:33.055211+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T06:28:25.980155+00:00","content_hash":"c1241c08bb529714c9dc993482f2f8b45ce3fd7c4c0d91a726b4abb559b00f6e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}